    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061128.0101\n\nSEOUL, Nov. 28 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nSeoul stock market closes down\n\n\n\n\nThe benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) lost 13.66 points to 1,411.47 on Tuesday.\n\nThe volume of the KOSPI was moderate at 246 million shares worth 2.85 trillion won (3.07 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe KOSDAQ index dropped 2.85 points to 612.93 with a volume of 655.32 million shares worth 2.184 trillion won (2.346 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe local currency finished at 930.80 won against one U.S. dollar, down 0.2 won from Monday's close.",
